Ring Pro Undead (Ring of Protection from Undead) is one of the rarest items in Wizardry I. Item databases identify it simply as
"Pro Undead" (protection
What that protection actually does was unclear for years, but analysis of the original game code indicates:
When an undead monster targets the protected character, there is roughly a 50% chance the monster's action simply fails and 
the monster loses its turn. This can affect melee attacks and other actions.
More importantly for Wizardry players:
Protection from undead can prevent attacks from undead that would otherwise inflict effects such as level drain or paralysis, because the attack never happens if the protection check succeeds.

